{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2021-12-15 08:29:00', 'title': 'PPG APPOINTS TIM KNAVISH CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF TIM KNAVISH, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 2022. KNAVISH WILL HAVE EXECUTIVE OVERSIGHT RESPONSIBILITY FOR ALL OF PPG'S STRATEGIC BUSINESS UNITS AND OPERATING REGIONS AND FOR THE INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY (IT), ENVIRONMENT, HEALTH AND SAFETY (EH&S), AND PROCUREMENT FUNCTIONS. HE WILL REMAIN BASED AT PPG'S GLOBAL HEADQUARTERS IN PITTSBURGH AND WILL CONTINUE TO REPORT TO CHAIR"}